pen/unmerged [#46](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/46) supplies validation; drafts [#50](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/50) and [#52](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/pull/52) add installed generation/handoff and source-bound held retention. #52 passes 129 locked tests/hooks and both GitHub checks. [Installed/archive evidence](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/blob/2796424c/experiments/51-held-retention/installed-results.md). Main is not promoted; no automatic merge/release.\n\n**Current experiment:** actual child [#53](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/53) has launched the checkpointed installed controller for two official-listed AnnData PRs (one fix and its backport). Native generation/controls are pending; no fresh accepted pair or new unique task is established. Same official model/settings, verifier and resource profile; no APT prefix, timeout change or extra repair. [Inputs](https://github.com/Open-Athena/biotasks/commit/c07470ee).\n\n**Findings:** #45’s known Cobrapy export failed clean recipe reconstruction. #47’s explicit generic build policy reached 300-second verifier timeouts/null rewards inconsistent with late files. #49/#51 preserved those original bytes, verified anonymous HF copies and original owned cleanup without regrading. Installed retention covers this pinned failure family; unknown cases and unresolved admission/billing still hold.\n\n**Budget/status:** at #53 launch, actual 9.596001/32 CPUh and $0.287646/11original calls; generation reserved 6.333333 CPUh and $13.07 plus the existing $10 archival reservation. Reservations are not spend. Same $90 operating ceiling, strictly below $100 extra, existing reserved CPUs only. All earlier jobs are terminal; #53 is the active controller. Detailed logs/current accounting in comments.\n\nOriginal #28 stays closed at 83 exports / 82 ever-positive / 67 ever-clean, 25 public-eligible / 58 Matchms withheld. Keep this epic/children open for review. Scientific acceptance, workflow completion and release readiness remain separate.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Open-Athena/biotasks/issues/33/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}